refactor: eliminate mock data and integrate real backend APIs for local file processing

Frontend:
- Remove DevApiFallback from ipc.ts - all calls now route through window.electronAPI
- AnalyzePanel.tsx: use real ASR, emotion, and highlight data from backend
- EditPanel.tsx: convert backend highlights to segments for editing
- RecommendPanel.tsx: use real clipApi.recommend endpoint
- ExportPanel.tsx: use real enqueue/export endpoint
- taskQueueStore.ts: integrate backend polling with results data

Backend:
- handlers.py: complete RPC handler layer for all IPC endpoints
- manager.py: ASR + emotion + highlight analysis pipeline
- direct_cut/pipeline.py: direct cutting pipeline
- narration/pipeline.py: AI narration pipeline
- highlight/scorer.py: highlight scoring algorithm
- model_manager.py: model management service
- ffmpeg_config.py: FFmpeg profile configuration
- project/manager.py: project CRUD operations
- scene_sorter.py: scene detection and sorting
- ffmpeg_utils.py: FFmpeg utility functions
- video_processor.py: video processing utilities
- audio_merger.py: audio merging service
- clip_video.py: video clip operations
- merger_video.py: video merging operations

Resources:
- ffmpeg.exe and ffprobe.exe binaries
- Ollama integration plan documentation

Cleanup:
- Remove test files, temporary scripts, and logs

